  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Refugee Leadership Through the Resourcing Refugee Leadership Initiative (RRLI) &#x2013; Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The RRLI Lebanon programme supports refugee-led and community-based organizations through direct funding, capacity strengthening, and meaningful participation in decision-making. The programme aims to strengthen locally led responses to displacement by enhancing organizational sustainability, service delivery, and community engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
