  <sector code="15150" percentage="100" vocabulary="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity is classified under DAC sector code 15150 (Democratic participation and civil society) as it advances the leadership, agency, and institutional capacity of refugee-led organisations within civil society systems. The programme enables displaced populations to actively participate in decision-making processes and to design and deliver locally grounded interventions that respond to community needs. Through flexible funding, capacity strengthening, and meaningful participation mechanisms, the activity contributes to strengthening inclusive, locally led civil society structures and enhancing the role of refugee-led actors in shaping responses in fragile and displacement-affected contexts.</narrative>
  </sector>
